      "writtenOn": "2023-05-16T09:02:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the issue would always happen if we include the `fpsensor_state.h`.\n\nI don\u0027t have a good idea to do that without doing a huge refactor of existing fpsensor_state code.\n\nThe proper way to do that is packing all fpsensor_state variables into a \"context\", and passing it around.\n\nBut I don\u0027t want to do a huge refactor now, because that may introduce too much risk.",
      "parentUuid": "4f6cadfe_78fd09b1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 50,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 50,
        "endChar": 38
