      "writtenOn": "2023-05-29T06:49:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done.\n\nBut the idea of `test/fpsensor_auth_crypto_mock.c` doesn\u0027t work.\n\nBecause the main problem of the device test is not the `mock`, the problem is we are linked to the `fpsensor_state.cc`, and it will include fpesnsor_state.h \u0026 fpsensor_driver.h. That will end up with `\"Sensor type not defined!\"` in `driver/fingerprint/fpc/fpc_sensor.h`.\n\nAnd I don\u0027t want to do a refactor on the existing design of fpsensor driver interface.",
